cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "lagprotest: Lagged Procrustean Randomization Test for Multivariate Time Series"
abstract: >-
  R package that extends the Procrustean randomization test (PROTEST) to
  ordered multivariate series. Concordance between two configurations is
  scanned across candidate temporal lags. Significance is assessed with
  phase-randomized surrogates (default), cyclic shifts of the full series or
  free permutation of rows, and a global max-statistic p-value accounts for
  scanning several lags and selecting the best one. Returns the lag profile,
  the lag of maximal concordance and per-observation Procrustes residuals.
authors:
